"""KNM Work Orders module — Flask Blueprint added alongside the vending
dashboard. Everything in this file is additive:

  • New tables prefixed WO_* — does not touch MachineLookup, MasterData
    Table or MasterCode.
  • Own permission helpers — does not alter existing role decorators.
  • All routes mounted under /api/wo/* — no collision with existing routes.

Tabs in the new "Work Orders" UI:
  Tab 1 Complaint Submission — any signed-in user with any role.
  Tab 2 Field Ops             — operator / field_manager / admin.
  Tab 3 Work Order Assignment — field_manager / admin.
  Tab 4 Manager View          — field_manager / admin.
"""
